\fs14\
\fs28 \pard \s3 \li1512 \fi0 \ri1007 \ql \tx3603 \tx3981 \tx4359 Returns NO if the selection mode of the NSMatrix is NSListModeMatrix, YES if the NSMatrix is in any other selection mode. The NSMatrix does not accept first mouse in NSListModeMatrix to prevent the loss of multiple selections. The NSEvent parameter, \i theEvent\i0 , is ignored.\
